flowchart TD
Start["**MOO Optimization**<br/>Objectives wip min and throughput max"]
InputVars["**Input Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities decision variables with discrete range {1-10}"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Defines MOO problem for capacities<br/>n_var 6 xl {1-10} xu {1-10} n_replications configurable"]
NSGA2Algo["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Population and generations control<br/>sampling integer random crossover SBX mutation PM"]
Evaluator["_EvaluateNode"]["**Problem _evaluate**<br/>Builds tasks for each individual<br/>uses multiprocessing with n_cores 50"]
MPPool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Parallel map of evaluate_single_individual<br/>manages worker processes"]
EvaluateIndividual["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>Runs multiple replications per individual<br/>aggregates avg wip and avg throughput as objectives"]
RunWithCaps["**run_simulation_with_caps**<br/>Receives seed and capacity vector<br/>constructs DelayBuffer instances with decision caps<br/>builds machines and topology and runs simulation"]
RunSim["**run_simulation**<br/>Core simulation engine used by both flows<br/>warmup sampling measurement collects throughput wip and per machine energy"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer Class**<br/>Attributes env cap delay tokens store in_transit<br/>Methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
MachineClass["**Machine Class**<br/>Attributes name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity resource stats is_up<br/>Methods run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
Results["**Objective Results**<br/>Returns avg wip and negative avg throughput for pymoo<br/>per individual result fed back to NSGA2"]
HistoryExport["**Export History CSV**<br/>Writes generation history with decision caps wip throughput to CSV file"]
ManagerFlow["**Simulation Manager**<br/>part generation splitter merger sampling wip collection<br/>resets and aggregates machine stats"]

Start --> InputVars
InputVars --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> MPPool
MPPool --> EvaluateIndividual
EvaluateIndividual --> RunWithCaps
RunWithCaps --> RunSim
RunSim --> DelayBufferClass
RunSim --> MachineClass
RunSim --> ManagerFlow
RunSim --> Results
Results --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> HistoryExport

DelayBufferClass ---|used by| RunWithCaps
MachineClass ---|instantiated by| RunWithCaps
ManagerFlow ---|orchestrates| RunSim
MPPool ---|returns results to| Evaluator
HistoryExport ---|consumes| NSGA2Algo

